before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>

int measure(int *result) {
 if (result != NULL) { *result = 6; }
 return 1;
}
int main(void) {
 int n = 0;
 int ok = measure(&n);
 printf("%d %d\n", ok, n);
}
```

